				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				79,
				4
			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Add retry logic for extension scanning and node_modules fallback\n\nImplement a 5-retry polling mechanism in ExtensionsScannerService to handle the case where Mountain is still scanning extensions when the first editor window opens. Each retry waits 1000ms before querying again, with telemetry logging for debugging.\n\nAlso add VSCodeNodeModules fallback path to resolve packages from the VS Code dependency tree when not found in local node_modules. This enables copying `vscode-textmate` and `vscode-oniguruma` language detection packages.\n\nAdd `@codeeditorland/cocoon` as a runtime dependency for extension host support.",
			"SHA": "1729c51761803ff9469be926e7d52a0d8eae8ea6"
		}
